--- /dev/null
+++ b/KIO-FORK.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# KIO Film
+
+Independent KIO branding fork of [FilmCraft v0.8.0](https://github.com/storytold/filmcraft/tree/f03e21556d8e3a7155b91892d958debd5255d7af), originally by the ArtCraft team and contributors. KIO branding is not endorsed by ArtCraft.
+
+Original engine, codecs, formats and features are retained. Original LICENSE, NOTICE, contributor credits and asset attribution remain applicable and are preserved. KIO icon is the existing user-supplied KIO artwork; no ArtCraft trademark logo is included.
+
+Inherited limitations: Cannot open Premiere .prproj; no VST3/AU/OpenFX hosting; footage performance, platform testing and delivery-codec limitations remain.
+
+This patch has not been compiled or functionally verified. Do not describe it as a completed native release until the platform build, profile separation and file round-trip checks pass.
